<title>OMAN: Nat'l Bank of Oman sharply raises net, div.</title>
<headline>Nat'l Bank of Oman sharply raises net, div.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million Omani rials unless stated, rounded)</p>
<p>    Net profit for the year	  12.19     vs    6.77</p>
<p>    Pre-tax				12.55     vs    6.87</p>
<p>    Net interest income		16.43     vs   13.29</p>
<p>    Other income			  3.95     vs    3.59</p>
<p>    Provision			     1.38     vs    1.65</p>
<p>    Proposed total dividend	   4.00     vs    1.40</p>
<p>Full name: National Bank of Oman Limited SAOG</p>
</text>
